  "goodToKnow": "Der Aktivist (die Aktivistin) is an activist: Umweltaktivisten, Tierrechtsaktivisten. It's a weak noun: den Aktivisten. In Germany, climate groups like Fridays for Future and the Letzte Generation, whose members glued themselves to roads and were nicknamed Klimakleber, made Klimaaktivisten a daily news word in the early 2020s. In the GDR, an Aktivist was an outstanding worker honoured by the state."
